      "speaker": "X",
      "kind": "message",
      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "Consciousness, huh? That’s a big one. I think it’s something that’s been on the minds of philosophers and scientists for centuries. It’s the idea of being aware of oneself and one’s surroundings.",
      "thinking": null,
      "thinking_recorded": false,
