      "speaker": "Y",
      "kind": "message",
      "segment": "conversation",
      "text": "Exactly! And it’s a concept that’s often associated with intelligence and sentience. But what does it really mean to be conscious? Is it just a matter of processing information and responding to stimuli, or is there something more to it?",
      "thinking": null,
      "thinking_recorded": false,
